---
import { CalendarView } from "./CalendarView";
---

<section class="wrap py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="agenda">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
        <p class="eyebrow text-kit">Ritten &amp; activiteiten</p>
        <h2 id="agenda" class="font-display mt-3 text-5xl md:text-7xl">Agenda</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-sm text-ink/70">
          Alle geplande ritten en clubactiviteiten. Bekijk de route per groep,
          download de GPX of zet de rit meteen in je eigen agenda.
        </p>

        <aside class="mt-8 rounded-3xl bg-ink p-6 text-paper">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-signal text-ink"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.401 3.003c1.155-2 4.043-2 5.197 0l7.355 12.748c1.154 2-.29 4.5-2.599 4.5H4.645c-2.309 0-3.752-2.5-2.598-4.5L9.4 3.003ZM12 8.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v3.75a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0V9a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75Zm0 8.25a.75.75 0 1 0 0-1.5.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-bold">Wegenwerken gespot?</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-paper/70">
            Geef ons een seintje via mail of WhatsApp! Dan passen we de ritten
            snel aan, zodat iedereen veilig kan blijven fietsen.
          </p>
          <a
            href="mailto:info@pelotonmeilsen.be?subject=Wegenwerken%20op%20de%20route"
            class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-signal hover:underline hover:underline-offset-4"
          >
            info@pelotonmeilsen.be
          </a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <CalendarView client:only="react" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
